    "reviews": "\u201cinstead of being a commentary on whether socialism \u201cworks\u201d or how to achieve it, Democratic Socialism Simulator is simply a political game that treats democratic socialist policies like reasonable ideas, then plays out their trade-offs in a surprisingly adorable setting.\u201d<br>The Verge<br><br>\u201cThe game we didn\u2019t know we needed to survive this primary season\u201d<br>LA Times<br><br>\u201cI want to be friends with the Treasurer\u201d<br>Kotaku<br>",
